        "country_code": "ua",
        "front_dist_km": null,
        "text": "Mashovets assessed that the Russian military command appears unwilling to redirect forces from other areas to support Russian efforts toward Kupyansk and therefore concluded that Ukrainian forces will likely have the opportunity to strengthen their defenses in the Kupyansk direction.[39] Russian forces continued limited ground activity in the Borova direction on July 15 but did advance.",
        "source_url": "https://understandingwar.org/research/russia-ukraine/russian-offensive-campaign-assessment-july-15-2026/"
      }
