        "place": "Mayaky",
        "country_code": "ua",
        "front_dist_km": null,
        "text": "Geolocated footage published on July 14 shows Russian forces striking a Ukrainian pontoon bridge across the Siverskyi Donets River near Mayaky (north of Slovyansk) with FAB-500 guided glide bombs.[44] Russian forces previously struck the same location on July 10.[45] Russian forces continued offensive operations in the Kostyantynivka-Druzhkivka tactical area on July 14 and 15 but did not advance.",
        "source_url": "https://understandingwar.org/research/russia-ukraine/russian-offensive-campaign-assessment-july-15-2026/"
      }
    },
